  [^{:val 512 :doc "values the first chunk holds (queue 430): a thread that never runs deep (a forked thread blocked for good: CML's\nlosing choices in nofib's threads007, 100,000 of them, held a whole chunk each, 256 KB, until the 16 GiB cap) takes 8 KB\n" :go/pos {:name-pos [16 2]}} arenaFirst ^{:go/apos {1 [16 15] 2 [16 20]} :go/pos {:op-pos [16 17]}} (<< 1 9)])


